WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.376 --> 00:00:05.039
Accounts: log in with a mobile number and a one-time password.

2
00:00:05.039 --> 00:00:11.315
Log in with a mobile number. Accept the terms and get an OTP.

3
00:00:11.315 --> 00:00:14.869
Mock mode shows the OTP: 123456. A full code submits itself.

4
00:00:14.869 --> 00:00:21.039
First login on this browser: set a 4-digit PIN for next time.

5
00:00:21.039 --> 00:00:28.538
Logged in. The session survives a reload (an httpOnly refresh cookie).

6
00:00:28.538 --> 00:00:34.364
The profile menu masks the mobile number and shows the KYC status.

7
00:00:34.364 --> 00:00:38.041
This browser is trusted, so next time it asks only for the PIN.

8
00:00:38.041 --> 00:00:41.340
Back in with four digits. Five wrong PINs lock it; an OTP always works.
